[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Heracles Software Requirements Specification for Head Interface Board Application
UID: DHF-HRC-0023
METADATA:
  COMPONENT: hvps-interface/main

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @grammar

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Purpose

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The purpose of this document is to provide Software Requirements Specifications for the Heracles Head
Interface Firmware (FW).
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document describes all requirements of the Heracles Head Interface FW.
The information in this document has been derived from the VoxelRay Heracles Product Requirements
Specification, referenced in this document.

\*The term Software applies to both Software and Firmware systems.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Abbreviations and Definitions

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
FW
  Firmware

LED
  Light Emitting Diode

MCU
  Microcontroller Unit

PRS
  Product Requirements Specification

SDP
  Software Development Plan

SRS
  Software Requirements Specification

SW
  Software
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Overview

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The head interface firmware is used to read various input data from peripherals such as cooling system
sensors, magnetometers, and collimator identification. This firmware sends feedback information to the
main control application firmware. The head interface firmware can also set various patterns to the head
base LED ring for visual indication. The pattern is based off commands received from the main control
application firmware. The head interface FW can also enable and disable alignment lasers or illumination
LEDs based on membrane keypad inputs.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: References

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
EMS-WI-057-13: Generating Documents and Traceability Matrix Analysis in Ketryx WI

EMS-SOP-057: Software Design Control

DHF-HRC-0001, Rev 2: Heracles Software Development Plan (SDP)

DHF-HRC-0003, Rev 2: Heracles Software Verification Plan (SVP)

DHF-HRC-0002: VoxelRay Product Requirements Specification (PRS)
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
PREFIX: RQ-H1FHI-
TITLE: Requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FHI-1
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Cooling system temperature
STATEMENT: >>>
The head interface firmware shall be able to read and convert a feedback signal for the system’s
cooling water temperature
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FHI-2
TYPE: Safety
TITLE: Collimator Interlock
STATEMENT: >>>
The head interface firmware shall monitor the presence of the collimator during emission and
trigger an interlock fault during emission if the collimator disconnects
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FHI-5
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Head lasers
STATEMENT: >>>
The head interface firmware shall alternately enable and disable the head lasers after the
detection of a user pressing the associated membrane button
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FHI-6
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Illumination LEDs
STATEMENT: >>>
The head interface firmware shall alternately enable and disable the illumination LEDs on the head
LED board after detection of a user pressing the associated membrane button
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FHI-8
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Main Board Communication
STATEMENT: >>>
The head interface board shall periodically report values to the main control board at a rate
greater than 1 Hz
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FHI-9
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Collimator
STATEMENT: >>>
The head interface firmware shall be able to read and report the digital ID value of a collimator
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FHI-10
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Magnetometers readings
STATEMENT: >>>
The head interface firmware shall be able to read and report magnetic field sensor data from two
magnetometers.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FHI-11
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Membrane key switches
STATEMENT: >>>
The head interface firmware shall be able to monitor and report the states of 5 independent
membrane key switches.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FHI-12
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Cooling system flow
STATEMENT: >>>
The head interface firmware shall be able to read and report a feedback signal for the system’s
cooling water flow rate
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FHI-13
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Cooling system pressure
STATEMENT: >>>
The head interface firmware shall be able to read and report a feedback signal for the system’s
cooling water pressure
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FHI-53
TYPE: Safety
TITLE: QC Read
STATEMENT: >>>
The head interface firmware shall be able to read and report x-ray sensor data from two diodes
when a quality check collimator is mounted
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: RQ-H1FHI-55
TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Robot Hand Guidance Button
STATEMENT: >>>
The head interface firmware shall monitor the activity state of the hand guidance button and pass
it to the robotic arm controller
<<<

[[/SECTION]]
